A line-block opener in a quote leaves no paragraph for a lazy line

```
- > ::: |
  a
b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <div class="line-block">

      </div>
    </blockquote>
    a
b
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
> - > ::: |
>   a
b
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <blockquote>
        <div class="line-block">

        </div>
      </blockquote>
      a
b
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```
